@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@auctionId = 1
@imageId = 1
@sessionCookie = replace-with-session-cookie-value

### List public auction image metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auctions/{{auctionId}}/images

### Upload an image as the auction seller
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auctions/{{auctionId}}/images
Cookie: SimpleAuctions.Session={{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: image/png

< ./Database/sample-images/ferrari-812-superfast.png

### Download an auction image
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auctions/{{auctionId}}/images/{{imageId}}
